//real-user-reported follow-up to #653's teventStubs batch - e_npc_bleed, same real archive
//shape as the player's own BleedingEffectPlugin (landed-hit DoT, stacks onto itself, fades
//out, auto-removes at 0 damage) but deliberately a SEPARATE def/plugin pair (user's explicit
//choice) so monster-bite bleed tunes independently from the thief "Bleeding Strike" ability -
//no shared Def: fields needed beyond what FadingEffectDurationPlugin already provides
//(TickInterval/MaxTicks/MaxPower/PluginKey).
[PluginTemplate NpcBleedEffectPlugin : FadingEffectDurationPlugin]
